{"ID":"20240513083402-gd3wvq6","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083402-gd3wvq6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083402-gd3wvq6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513110015-2k5rx95\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513110015-2k5rx95\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513110015-2k5rx95\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:220,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:220\u0026#125;","title":"052","type":"doc","updated":"20240515124053"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513110015-2k5rx95","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1011px;","id":"20240513110015-2k5rx95","updated":"20240515124053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/04/25"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"050-4 H, YT"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"05/02/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服前方後, 覺得非常疲憊. 胸悶, 並且整個胸腔皆痛(原來集中在心區痛)"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→倪師曰：因上方有紫參在攻她陰實。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 無法入眠, 入眠後, 僅睡三至四個鐘頭便醒."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 體力較差"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 胃口平平"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 大便正常"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 足熱身涼"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 手足不麻"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 呼吸好("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺活量恢復"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 口渴減少"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"緩有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白乾"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"查手掌溫手臂涼額溫，面色紅(夏逢夏色)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"作針灸療程中"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 針同前穴"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治方以桔梗甘草湯配合射干麻黃湯"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肺法象天幕, 肺冷手腳溫熱為正常, 常態為上冷下熱, 肺屬金, 心屬火, 金和火之間的關係為心臟博動時,其產生的熱由肺控制. 後肺金將熱往下壓, 引導熱進入小腸, 再進入雙腳. 此乃心移熱於小腸. 陰陽循環, 若有陰實症狀時, 半夜一點到三點或三點到五點會醒. 若陰實現象加重, 則陰陽分隔; 熱欲下行而不得, 則反逆. 所以上身燥熱, 下身仍冷. 有云”藥不瞑眩, 疾弗瘳” 中病, 不單指頭昏, 亦會有倦怠無力之現象. 故病人服用紫參時雖覺疲憊, 但足熱身涼. 利用病人仍有體力時, 以藥攻之. 此病須顧胃氣, 守肝臟使其不病進(金克木), 再守心臟, 則金無以為繼, 乃可以生水, 五行相生則正常."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}